@page
@model PortfolioManager.Web.Pages.Legal.DisclaimerModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Disclaimer";
}

<div class="col-lg-9">
    <h1 class="h2 pb-2 mb-3 border-bottom">Disclaimer</h1>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">General information only</h2>
    <p>
        @Model.SiteName gives general information and calculations based on the records you enter. It is not financial
        product advice, tax advice or legal advice, and it does not take your objectives, financial situation or needs into
        account. Think about whether it suits your circumstances, and get advice from a licensed adviser or registered tax
        agent before acting on it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Check the figures</h2>
    <p>
        Reports, tax schedules, BAS figures and capital gains are worked out from what you entered or imported, using
        rules that may be simplified and that change over time. They may contain errors. Check them against your source
        documents, or have your own tax agent check them, before you lodge, pay or rely on them.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Not a tax agent service</h2>
    <p>
        Using the site does not make @Model.Operator, or anyone who runs it, your tax or BAS agent, even if they are
        registered as one.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Prices and outside data</h2>
    <p>
        Share prices, exchange rates and other market data come from outside providers. They may be delayed, incomplete or
        wrong, and are not a quote to buy or sell.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">The AI assistant</h2>
    <p>
        Answers from the assistant are written by an AI model. They can be wrong or out of date, and any change it suggests
        is only saved after you approve it.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
        Your rights under the Australian Consumer Law are not affected. See the <a asp-page="/Legal/Terms">terms of use</a>
        for how our liability is limited.
    </p>
</div>
